# build/ is GENERATED OUTPUT ONLY — no manifests live here anymore (see
# deps/clode, deps/claude). Two subtrees now live here (see
# scripts/platform-tag.cjs's file header for the why): build/<artifact-name>/
# (shippable per-host output — naude, clode --self, deps.tar/sig, sea-*) and
# build/bundle/ (the platform-independent esbuilt bundles). The toolchain
# cache (esbuild/postject) and the patched-tjs engine template moved OFF this
# tree entirely — they now resolve through build-scratch.cjs's buildPath(),
# outside any clode source checkout — so build/toolchain/ and build/tjs/ are
# no longer subtrees that appear here at all.
build/*
node_modules/
test/.harness/
*.tgz
*.cjs.cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Superpowers working docs (plans, approaches, skill scratch) — not part of the project
docs/

# macOS cruft
.DS_Store
._*

# QuickJS-phase-1 vendor checkouts/builds/tarballs (artifacts; PINS.md records versions)
spike/quickjs/vendor/

bench/results/
